    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 53, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 The Executioner who held the Execution Grounds during the Peasant Riot, and executed countless innocent farmers at the command of Duke Ashton. Eventually, he was murdered for his actions. Due to the crimes he committed when alive, he was cursed never to rest in peace, and endlessly wanders in the Execution Grounds. Undead Lv. 1 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Undead. HP Recovery +10% Received P. Crit. Rate -5 Received Critical Damage -5% Received M. Crit. Damage -5% Vampiric Rage effect +1% Bow Skill Vampiric Rage effect +3% Resistance to Bleed +20% Resistance to Holy -10% Light Armor Type Lv. 3 Weak P. Def. and strong Evasion. Holy Vulnerability Lv. 2 Vulnerable to Divinity attack. Dark Attack Lv. 1 Unleashes a dark attack. Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
